Our partners', N'Water Academy', N'The training arm of the Saudi Water Authority - Our mission is to build capacity and develop competencies in the water sector by providing individuals with knowledge and empowering companies with a professional, specialized, and efficient workforce that supports innovation and keeps pace with the latest technologies and international standards.', 'en', NULL)
