Strategic Goals
Building an open ecosystem for research and innovation to achieve sustainable water resource management.​
Enhancing research and industrial collaboration and engaging stakeholders.​
Developing innovative water technologies and solutions to achieve competitive technical, economic, and environmental goals.​', N'WTIIRA institute', N'About Water Water Technologies Innovation Institute and Research Advancements (WTIIRA)​', 'en', NULL)
