INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e57-7595-ab6d-30273ebe7786', N'019fa37a-8e57-7474-8727-483190f3037a', N'Research areas', N'Explore the various research areas focused on innovative water treatment and desalination technologies, including pre-treatment, reverse osmosis, renewable energy, and more.', N'Processes Innovation
Clean and Renewable Energy
Circular Economy
Sustainable
Processes Innovation
A research group with focus on process development and continuous improvement, aiming to deliver innovative solutions that enhance operational efficiency and excellence in water systems. Through the integration of advanced membrane technologies, digital innovations, and two-dimensional (2D) materials, the group addresses key challenges across a wide range of water treatment processes, including desalination, wastewater treatment, water reuse, agricultural applications, and water transmission.
Research Objectives
Improving processes efficiency using advanced technologies, automation, and robotics.​
Developing novel membrane technologies through innovative materials and advanced coating methods.​
Integrate 2D materials to significantly enhance membrane performance.​
Expand the scope of water treatment and reuse applications.​
Innovate in water transmission and distribution technologies to improve reliability and reduce water loss.​
Research Areas
Process optimization and efficiency improvement​
Advanced membrane technologies​
Integration of two-dimensional (2D) materials​
Water reuse and agricultural applications​
Emerging contaminants and wastewater treatment​
AI-supported monitoring and prediction of processes and operations​', N'Research areas', N'Explore the various research areas focused on innovative water treatment and desalination technologies, including pre-treatment, reverse osmosis, renewable energy, and more.', 'en', NULL)
