INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e56-7c71-8668-3524723473f1', N'019fa37a-8e56-7948-8e43-fefc97a87dd0', N'The Authority and Community', N'The Authority and Community', N'Social Responsibility
At the Saudi Water Authority, we believe that community and national engagement embodies our commitment to social responsibility and strengthens our alignment with the objectives of Saudi Vision 2030 and its ambitious programs. Through our diverse initiatives, we strive to collaborate with all relevant entities to help raise public awareness on issues related to water security and sustainability.
Initiatives
Water Academy
In line with our belief that integrated efforts are fundamental to building sustainable communities, the Saudi Water Authority established Ajyal Academy to raise awareness among future generations about water conservation practices and to foster a generation of innovators in the water sector. Through this academy, we aim to enhance social impact by promoting water resource stewardship and reinforcing sustainability values through active community engagement.
Quality of Life Enhancement
At the Saudi Water Authority, we are committed to improving the urban landscape and expanding green spaces across the Kingdom''s governorates and public facilities. Our efforts also extend to raising awareness about healthy lifestyle choices and supporting community development goals. In addition, we organize a range of humanitarian initiatives as part of our firm commitment to social responsibility.
Innovation Support
We believe that innovation is a cornerstone of water security and a driver of national economic growth. The Saudi Water Authority is dedicated to supporting high-impact initiatives and nurturing innovators in water technologies, thereby enriching local content and turning creative ideas into tangible solutions. In line with this vision, we launched the SWA Thon Innovators Hackathon a program featuring five specialized tracks that offers participants the opportunity to work in multidisciplinary teams to develop innovative solutions to water sector challenges using creative thinking methods and modern technologies.
Our Programs
Pilgrims Service Program
Tamkeen Program
Volunteer Program', N'The Authority and Community', N'The Authority and Community', 'en', NULL)
GO
