INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e57-782b-9438-549f0c8c27b8', N'019fa37a-8e57-7518-a2c2-146af627765e', N'MAEE Center', N'Under Royal Decree No. (336) dated 06/20/1442 AH, the National Water Efficiency and Conservation Center (MAEE), was established to enhance water efficiency a...', N'MAEE Center
Under Royal Decree No. (336) dated 06/20/1442 AH, the National Water Efficiency and Conservation Center (MAEE), was established to enhance water efficiency and conservation. It aims to consolidate the efforts of both governmental and non-governmental entities in this domain.​​
Roles
Developing national programs that enhance water efficiency and conservation.
Defining performance indicators and objectives, and formulating plans and policies.
Establishing the necessary steps to achieve the objectives, and monitoring outcomes and effectiveness.
Encouraging investment and financing in areas that promote water efficiency and conservation.
Establishing regulations for accrediting and licensing water efficiency and conservation service providers.
Providing technical and advisory services in the field of water efficiency and conservation.
Vision
To be a leading model in water efficiency and conservation , contributing toward achieving water sustainability. ​
Mission
Empowering water-wise strategies in the Kingdom through raising awareness, seamless collaboration with partners, and the facilitation of optimal sustainable practices aligned with economic efficiency.
Values
Passion
Collaboration
Excellence
Innovation
Transparency
Objectives
Contributing in water efficiency across the supply chain​
Water usage conservation​
Water awareness​
