INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e57-7728-82c9-594808f114ab', N'019fa37a-8e57-7201-9df5-6abf16bfc1dc', N'National Water Company', N'The National Water Company is a Saudi joint-stock company fully owned by the state through the Public Investment Fund. Established in 2008, it specializes in...', N'National Water Company
The National Water Company is a Saudi joint-stock company, fully owned by the state through the Public Investment Fund (PIF). Established in 2008, the company provides water and wastewater services based on sound commercial principles and in line with the latest international standards.
Roles
Providing water and sanitation services in line with the latest international standards.
Connecting all customers to water and sanitation networks.
Preserving natural water resources and protecting the environment.
Vision
To deliver high-quality, sustainable water services across all regions of the Kingdom, enhancing quality of life today and into the future.​
Mission
We aim to provide water and related services, and to continuously improve service quality across the Kingdom in collaboration with our partners, by enhancing efficiency and effectiveness while achieving financial sustainability.​
Values
Customer First
Mutual Respect
Transparency
Committed Teamwork
Innovation
Objectives
Improving the quality of water services.
Expanding water and sanitation networks.
Minimizing the environmental impact of our operations.
