INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e58-7d0c-b774-a48c59c61260', N'019fa37a-8e58-797a-b144-1c5925494b9e', N'Use and Disclaimer', N'The Saudi Water Authority provides comprehensive terms of use, privacy policies, and Intellectual Property Rights protections to ensure user trust and compliance with global standards. As sustainability is one of our core values, we follow an ambitious roadmap aligned with the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia’s Vision 2030, ensuring transparency and security in every aspect of our operations. Use and Disclaimer', N'Terms of Use
The Terms of Use state that all users accessing the Saudi Water Authority''s website or using its services must comply with local laws and regulations. The site may not be used for illegal purposes or to infringe on the rights of others. Unauthorized use of the content or services may subject the user to legal action. The Authority reserves the right to modify or update the Terms of Use at any time, and users are encouraged to review the policy regularly to ensure compliance with the conditions.
Disclaimer
The Saudi Water Authority assumes no liability for direct or indirect damages that may result from the use of the website or the services provided. The information on the site is for informational purposes only and should not be relied upon for legal or business decisions. All external links provided are for convenience, and the Authority bears no responsibility for the content or policies of external sites. Users are advised to verify the accuracy and validity of the information before taking any actions.
Usage Limits
The Saudi Water Authority sets usage limits for the site and the services it offers. Reproduction or redistribution of any content from the site without prior written consent is prohibited. Information available on the site should be used for personal and non-commercial purposes, and content cannot be distributed or modified for commercial purposes. Any attempt to hack or manipulate the site''s data will be considered a legal violation and dealt with strictly by the Authority.', N'Use and Disclaimer', N'The Saudi Water Authority provides comprehensive terms of use, privacy policies, and Intellectual Property Rights protections to ensure user trust and compliance with global standards. As sustainability is one of our core values, we follow an ambitious roadmap aligned with the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia’s Vision 2030, ensuring transparency and security in every aspect of our operations. Use and Disclaimer', 'en', NULL)
GO
