It is an independent company fully owned by the Government of Saudi Arabia, the Water Transmission Company represents the Supervisory Committee for the Privatization of the Environment, Water, and Agriculture Sector.Its establishment is one of the key outcomes of the Privatization Program in support of Saudi Vision 2030, aligned with the National Water Strategy’s strategic objectives. The company aims to position Saudi Arabia as a leader in water transmission and storage, while contributing to long-term water security.​
Roles
Project Development​
Water Transmission​
