INSERT [dbo].[PageTranslations] ([Id], [PageId], [Title], [Summary], [Body], [SeoTitle], [SeoDescription], [Language], [Sections]) VALUES (N'019fa37a-8e58-7739-9f71-f0cc30ab5aff', N'019fa37a-8e58-74f0-8baf-e959da13bd11', N'WTIIRA’s Services', N'WTIIRA is one of the well established institute in the region that is specialized in water industry research, possessing infrastructure for research, development, and innovation, including centralized laboratories equipped with the latest technologies for analysis and testing following global standards and methodologies. The infrastructure also includes pilot stations covering many water technologies for various research and industrial material evaluation purposes.​', N'WTIIRA is one of the well established institute in the region that is specialized in water industry research, possessing infrastructure for research, development, and innovation, including centralized laboratories equipped with the latest technologies for analysis and testing following global standards and methodologies. The infrastructure also includes pilot stations covering many water technologies for various research and industrial material evaluation purposes.
Types of Service
WTIIRA has a distinguished team of scientists, experts, and researchers specialized in various water and related environmental technologies. This well professional team is capable of providing a wide range of research services, including engineering, scientific, and environmental. Following services are provided by the institute:
Research and Consulting Services
(GWIP)
Research collaboration requests
Industrial material evaluation
Consulting studies
Laboratory and Pilot Station Services', N'WTIIRA’s Services', N'WTIIRA is one of the well established institute in the region that is specialized in water industry research, possessing infrastructure for research, development, and innovation, including centralized laboratories equipped with the latest technologies for analysis and testing following global standards and methodologies. The infrastructure also includes pilot stations covering many water technologies for various research and industrial material evaluation purposes.​', 'en', NULL)
